        <description>This topic is triggered when a user asks for recommendations on which customers or accounts to meet with next. It directly calls the GetNBC action to retrieve this information and presents the list to the user. No further input is required from the user.Example Phrases (Utterances) &quot;who else could I meet with?&quot; &quot;recommend top account for me&quot; &quot;who are the next best customers&quot; &quot;who are the next best accounts&quot; &quot;show me the next best accounts&quot; &quot;find my top accounts&quot; &quot;who should I target next?&quot; &quot;suggest some customers&quot;</description>
